.TH PSModelChainHead 3 2024-03-09 "PsyC 0.9.5" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
\fBPSModelChainHead\fR

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/psyc.h>

.I
PSModel  *
.br
\fBPSModelChainHead\fR(\fIPSModel *model\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Get the first model (head) of the multi-model chain that contains \fImodel\fR.
.br
If \fImodel\fR is not a multi-model chain, the function will return the \fImodel\fR itself.  

.SH RETURN VALUES
The first model of the chain or \fINULL\fR if:

.RS 4
\[bu] \fImodel\fR is \fINULL\fR
.br

\[bu] the chain is broken.
.br
.RE

.SH SEE ALSO
psyc(1), PSAddModel(3), PSGetModelAtIndex(3), PSModelChainContains(3), PSModelChainLength(3), PSModelChainTail(3)
